From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: phpv patch conversion <patches@phpv.invalid>
Subject: [0001-gcc15-compat] ICU 58.x: select strtod_l header per platform

ICU 58.x on modern toolchains: xlocale.h was removed in glibc 2.26+
(merged into locale.h), but macOS still needs it for strtod_l. Select
the header by platform: locale.h on Linux/Windows, xlocale.h elsewhere.

---
diff --git a/source/i18n/digitlst.cpp b/source/i18n/digitlst.cpp
index ab5b557..9bfacaf 100644
--- a/source/i18n/digitlst.cpp
+++ b/source/i18n/digitlst.cpp
@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@
-# if U_PLATFORM_USES_ONLY_WIN32_API || U_PLATFORM == U_PF_CYGWIN
+# if U_PLATFORM_USES_ONLY_WIN32_API || U_PLATFORM == U_PF_CYGWIN || defined(__linux__)
 #   include <locale.h>
 # else
 #   include <xlocale.h>
 # endif
 #endif
 
